      "line": 12,
      "text": "### Providing Quality Senior Care Wherever You Call Home in the Essex County Area"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "We provide care in the home, wherever that may be. Whether you and your family need a short term companionship option or more in depth care, Right at Home Essex County, NJ can help you and your loved ones today!"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "We offer elder care services that will provide a piece of mind for you and your family as well as provide security and assistance to your loved one!"
    },
    {
      "line": 43,
      "text": "Caring for a senior can be difficult and demanding on a family."
    },
    {
      "line": 45,
      "text": "Right at Home of Essex County is here to help! Schedule your complimentary Custom Care Plan today at [(973) 669-1822](tel:973-669-1822) or [online](https://www.rightathome.net/essex-county/contact)!"
