    {
      "line": 173,
      "text": "## Join Our Team"
    },
    {
      "line": 175,
      "text": "Right at Home’s mission is simple...to improve the quality of life for those we serve. We accomplish this by providing the Right Care, and we deliver this brand promise each and every day around the world. However, we couldn’t do it without having the Right People. Our care teams are passionate about serving our clients and are committed to providing the personal care and attention of a friend, whenever and wherever it is needed."
    },
    {
      "line": 177,
      "text": "That’s where you come in. At Right at Home, we help ordinary people who have a passion to serve others become extraordinary care team members. We seek to find people who are compassionate, empathetic, reliable, determined and are focused on improving the quality of life for others."
    },
    {
      "line": 179,
      "text": "[See our open positions](https://www.rightathome.net/essex-county/jobs)"
    },
